  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.88,
      442.64,
      289.05,
      510.32
    ],
    "text": "I, hereby give notice, under Sub section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act No. 28 of 1964 (Amendement) that the Government intends to acquire the following land which is required for a public purpose.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.88,
      511.75,
      225.72,
      533.11
    ],
    "text": "Description of the land to be acquired:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.88,
      534.56,
      286.68,
      625.28
    ],
    "text": "An alloment of land called St. Bridget Estate in total extent of 0.3965 hectare depicted as Lot 01 in the Preliminary Plan No. Ku. 2307 situated in the Village called Gonawa in the Grama Niladhari Division No. 869 Weerambugedara in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Weerambugedara in Kurunegala District of the Northwestern Province and morefully described as follows:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.88,
      642.8,
      286.68,
      756.32
    ],
    "text": "Schedule Name of the Land: St. Bridget Estate; Preliminary Plan No.: Ku. 2307; Description: Home garden with a mix cultivation. Comprising eight coconut trees of 45-55 years old, three jack trees of 10-15 years old and four king coconut trees of 10-15 years old, a two storied permanent building, six permanent buildings, a temporary building and a water tank; Claimant: Land Reform Commission; Total Extent: 0.3965 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.56,
      355.28,
      577.28,
      468.8
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land are hereby required to appear personally or by agents duly authorized in writing before me at the Weerambugedara Divisional Secretariat on 18th day of March, 2015 at 10.00 and are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before 11th March 2015 the nature of their interests in the Land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.56,
      470.24,
      539.82,
      503.36
    ],
    "text": "All deeds and documents in support of the claims should be produced before me at the inquiry.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.56,
      504.8,
      539.88,
      537.92
    ],
